&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="crayons_icon_container"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://assets.dev.to/assets/raised-hands-74b2099fd66a39f2d7eed9305ee0f4553df0eb7b4f11b01b6b1b499973048fe5.svg" width="24" height="24"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
