&lt;p&gt;The combination of AI and IoT is creating a new wave of innovation. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://75way.com/iot-app-development-company" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;IoT app development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; enables devices to collect and share data, while AI analyzes that data to generate insights.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For example, in a smart factory, IoT sensors monitor machine performance, and AI systems predict when maintenance is needed. This prevents downtime and improves efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smart Ecosystems Powered by AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When AI and IoT work together, they create intelligent ecosystems. These systems can monitor environments, detect changes, and respond automatically. It’s like having a network of devices that think and act together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This integration is transforming industries such as healthcare, manufacturing, and logistics. Businesses can now operate more efficiently and make better decisions based on real-time data.&lt;/p&gt;

